    "name": "ShardSetsBase<TConfiguration>.ShardSetReadAll ListAsync family",
    "kind": "Library",
    "contract": "Executes a query contract across every shard in a shard set, or the shards named by supplied shard-specific values, and returns a combined List of column values, virtual compound keys, or virtual compound keys with child identities. Column-name variants identify the shard identifier, record identifier, and optional child identifier used to construct those key results.",
